  "description": "This was my first ring I ever designed for my brand back in 2012. I got it to work on the first iteration, and refined it to what it is today by the second version. It's set with a cross section of Uruguayan Amethyst. Carefully hand cut. I had the vision for this, and knew right away that Amethyst in Uruguay would be perfect, because of it's small crystal size and deep color relative to other amethyst. I wore one myself for many years.",
